#: code:addons/easyocr/static/src/xml/easyocr_admin.xml:0
msgid ""
"When you activate easyOCR AI, PDF documents are processed by an artificial "
"intelligence service that automatically extracts supplier, tax ID, dates, "
"amounts and invoice lines."
msgstr ""
"Quando ativa o easyOCR AI, os documentos PDF são processados por um serviço "
"de inteligência artificial que extrai automaticamente fornecedor, NIF, "
